### Gullaliko, 2025-07-02
I’ve reviewed the copy button functionality and identified that the Clipboard API may not work reliably across all browsers and platforms. I will prepare a PR that:

Uses the Clipboard API when supported,
Implements a  fallback method using document.execCommand('copy') for browsers where the Clipboard API is unavailable,
